[00:01.08]Ever onward, O my people,
[00:04.12]Let the Kingdom tidings go.
[00:07.96]Tremble not before our foe.
[00:11.68]Let all lovers of truth know
[00:15.02]That my reigning Son, Christ Jesus,
[00:19.04]To the earth has cast the foe,
[00:22.74]Soon to bind the Devil, Satan,
[00:26.16]Letting all his victims go.
[00:31.21](Chorus)
[00:31.36]Fear them not, O my beloved,
[00:35.73]Though their boasting threats may fly.
[00:44.36]I will keep my faithful servant
[00:50.06]As the apple of my eye.
[00:56.94]Even though your foes are many,
[01:06.44]Though they threaten and revile,
[01:10.20]Though they flatter and they smile,
[01:13.76]To mislead and to beguile.
[01:17.98]Fear them not, my faithful people,
[01:21.36]Nor their persecution’s heat,
[01:24.98]For I will preserve the faithful
[01:28.42]Till the vict’ry is complete.
[01:33.23](Chorus)
[01:33.38]Fear them not, O my beloved,
[01:38.70]Though their boasting threats may fly.
[01:47.14]I will keep my faithful servant
[01:52.46]As the apple of my eye.
[02:00.98]Never fear you are forgotten;
[02:04.34]I am still your strength and shield.
[02:08.08]Though you die upon the field,
[02:11.98]Even death to me will yield.
[02:15.84]Fear them not who kill the body
[02:19.08]But cannot destroy the soul.
[02:22.82]To the end may you be faithful;
[02:26.38]I will bring you to your goal!
[02:31.05](Chorus)
[02:31.20]Fear them not, O my beloved,
[02:37.94]Though their boasting threats may fly.
[02:45.52]I will keep my faithful servant
[02:52.56]As the apple of my eye.
